Z||000001||Haze_Performance||09-10-2001||03:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by kiss:<BR><B>who has info on race tech stainless dash kits.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>What info do ya need?<P>141 Turbine Drive - Weston, Ontario CANADA M9L 2S7<P>Tel. (416)747-5728 - <A HREF="http://www.thefieroshop.com" TARGET=_blank>www.thefieroshop.com</A> <P><BR>The panels are $175.00. You get 7 pieces. (Speedo cover, Radio Cover, GT/SE Aux. gauge cover, Cig. light panel cover, Shifter cover & both side heater vent covers. All the panels mount with stock screws. Except- Heater side vents (3M tape included) & Shifter cover. (4 little screws. included)<P>All have a very nice fit & I'm VERY happy with them.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">             <BR></A><BR><A HREF="http://www.clubs.yahoo.com/clubs/ws6fiero" TARGET=_blank>WS6 Fiero Club</A>||||reg||14
